559
00:18:40,551 --> 00:18:42,603
Your time and attention are freed up

560
00:18:42,603 --> 00:18:43,516
for your career,

561
00:18:43,516 --> 00:18:44,998
your family and your life.

562
00:18:45,347 --> 00:18:48,543
That's why many index investors use something

563
00:18:48,543 --> 00:18:50,532
like a three fund portfolio,

564
00:18:50,532 --> 00:18:50,816
a U.

565
00:18:50,996 --> 00:18:51,321
S.

566
00:18:51,501 --> 00:18:52,866
stock index fund,

567
00:18:52,866 --> 00:18:55,998
an international stock index fund and a

568
00:18:55,998 --> 00:18:57,282
bond index fund.

569
00:18:57,462 --> 00:18:59,339
Or even a single target date fund

570
00:18:59,339 --> 00:19:01,329
that handles the mix automatically.

571
00:19:01,678 --> 00:19:02,526
Try this.

572
00:19:02,706 --> 00:19:05,150
Write down your investing plan on one

573
00:19:05,150 --> 00:19:05,481
page.

