591
00:19:36,960 --> 00:19:38,498
consistency do the rest.

592
00:19:38,847 --> 00:19:40,252
Move number fifteen.

593
00:19:40,432 --> 00:19:41,930
Pick the right account first.

594
00:19:42,279 --> 00:19:43,854
Before you choose a fund,

595
00:19:43,854 --> 00:19:45,240
choose where it lives.

