00:22:12,949 --> 00:22:14,365
You don't need to time anything.

670
00:22:14,715 --> 00:22:18,001
Also turn on automatic dividend reinvestment.

671
00:22:18,181 --> 00:22:20,793
Index funds pay dividends from the companies

672
00:22:20,793 --> 00:22:23,167
