679
00:22:34,229 --> 00:22:35,774
Move number eighteen.

680
00:22:35,954 --> 00:22:37,602
Rebalance once a year.

681
00:22:37,952 --> 00:22:40,158
Over time, your mix drifts.

682
00:22:40,338 --> 00:22:42,292
If stocks grow faster than bonds,

683
00:22:42,292 --> 00:22:45,133
your portfolio becomes riskier than you planned.

684
00:22:45,313 --> 00:22:47,827
Rebalancing means selling a little of what

685
00:22:47,827 --> 00:22:49,743
