699
00:23:15,351 --> 00:23:16,745
which avoids selling.

700
00:23:17,094 --> 00:23:17,907
Try this.

701
00:23:18,087 --> 00:23:18,752
Pick a date,

702
00:23:18,752 --> 00:23:19,806
