706
00:23:26,082 --> 00:23:27,406
Move number nineteen.

707
00:23:27,586 --> 00:23:28,596
Stay the course.

708
00:23:28,946 --> 00:23:31,431
Bogle's favorite advice was two words.

709
00:23:31,611 --> 00:23:32,621
Stay the course.

710
00:23:32,801 --> 00:23:33,799
It sounds easy,

